  Exploratory, no pre-registration; every bucket is one of ~40 looks. A flagged bucket is a
  hypothesis to write down BEFORE Saturday's 44 CFB / Sunday's 12 NFL closes, then read there.
  Settlement is DERIVED from ESPN finals under the venue's frames; the caller spot-checks it
  against the venue's settlement endpoint before any number travels.

